# Block access entirely — @-mentions included.
# .cursorignore is NOT a security boundary (see SECURITY.md).
# Pair with hooks, approvals, and filesystem permissions.

# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/id_rsa
.cursor/mcp.local.json

# Local overrides
*.local
